OL,3,GNEWSAEvri van driver found without
OL,4,Ainsurance or licence
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice seized an Evri delivery van
OL,7,Fafter finding its driver had no
OL,8,Finsurance or valid driving licence.
OL,10,FThe vehicle, with about 100 packages
OL,11,Finside, was stopped in St Neots at
OL,12,Fabout 12:00 BST on Wednesday.
OL,14,FCambridgeshire Police also said
OL,15,Fdelivery of the parcels would have been
OL,16,F"a miracle", regardless of the seizure,
OL,17,Fgiven the state of the van's tyres.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
