OL,3,GNEWSAEvri van driver found without
OL,4,Ainsurance or licence
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvri said it took safety and compliance
OL,7,F"very seriously" and that the vehicle
OL,8,Fbelonged to a self-employed driver. It
OL,9,Fadded it expected the majority of the
OL,10,Fparcels involved to be delivered within
OL,11,Fits normal five-day target.
